 "moshi_text": "Hi, how is it going? Well, I'm ready for any fruit. Let's go. What are we going to talk about today? Oh, those are all good ones. I like watermelon. It's so refreshing on a hot day. Hmm. I've never had dragonfruit, but I've heard it's delicious. Hmm. I've never tried lychee before. I've heard it tastes like a mix of strawberry and pineapple. Hmm. I love raspberries. They're so sweet and juicy. Hmm. I've never tried breadfruit, but I've heard it's a staple food in many parts of Asia. Hmm. Peaches are one of my favorite fruits. They're sweet and juicy. Hmm. Blood oranges are really interesting. They're sweet and tangy.",
